reactivity on a single H100.

00:06:32.719 --> 00:06:38.719
Run the quick study canvas prompt inside Claude Opus 5.5 for a fast image-to-painting pass.

00:06:39.659 --> 00:06:43.299
Offline training environments are expected to keep spreading at major labs.

00:06:43.839 --> 00:06:48.419
More agent harnesses and security frameworks are expected as enterprises test production

00:06:48.419 --> 00:06:49.679
